  "seoTitle": "About | Advice4you, Norwich",
  "description": "Advice4you is a Norwich service that helps newcomers with the practical side of life in the UK. What we are, and what we are not.",
  "content": "<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772969737694-871675200a59?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=72\",\"dimRatio\":80,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#04070f\",\"minHeight\":420,\"align\":\"full\",\"alt\":\"The Norwich skyline with the cathedral spire and the castle\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:420px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-80 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#04070f\"></span><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"The Norwich skyline with the cathedral spire and the castle\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772969737694-871675200a59?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=72\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} -->\n<p class=\"kicker\">About</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A calm place to start.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Advice4you helps people who are new to the UK with the practical side of life here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f6f3ec\",\"text\":\"#0e1424\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f6f3ec;color:#0e1424;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moving to a new country means learning a new system while you also learn a new language. Most problems are not hard. They are just written in words that are hard to understand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We help you understand those words. We read the letter with you, explain the choices, and help you do the next step yourself or with our support. We are based in Norwich and help people across Norfolk.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>A local, independent service based in Norwich</li><li>Practical help with benefits, councils, the NHS, letters and forms</li><li>A guide to the right regulated help when you need it</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we are not</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Not a law firm and not solicitors</li><li>Not regulated to give immigration advice</li><li>Not a government office or a charity</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where we work</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are based in Norwich and help people across Norfolk. When you contact us, we agree together how and where to meet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#0b1530\",\"text\":\"#e8ecf2\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#0b1530;color:#e8ecf2;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bring us the letter. We will read it together.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send a short message. Tell us your name, your language and a few words about the problem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/447466951175?text=Hello%20Advice4you%2C%20I%20would%20like%20some%20help.\">Message us on WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
